      "content": "it doesnt matter though. even if i reach out to someone else, it's the same thing. it's like the world just moved on and left this empty space where i used to be. it’s honestly kind of peaceful in a weird way, just realizing that i'm already gone. like, why am i even trying to hold onto a life that nobody is looking at? it feels more real to just accept that i'm already a ghost.",
